<DocsExample TExample="ContainerViewDocumentExample" Title="Document with on-this-page navigation" Description="NTContainerView centers readable content and, by default, builds an On this page list from the h1 to h6 headings inside it. The list is added by the browser script of the component." />
<DocsExample TExample="ContainerViewNavLabelsExample" Title="Customizing the navigation" Description="data-nt-nav-label changes the text of a link, data-nt-nav-exclude omits a heading, and OnThisPageLabel and OnThisPageTitle rename the list." />
<DocsExample TExample="ContainerViewPlainExample" Title="Width only" Description="Set EnableOnThisPageNavigation to false to use the view purely as a centered, width-bounded wrapper." />
